# Runtime-only scoring data and the operator-generated standalone project
# bundle for the PICK-A17 Gazebo demonstration.
harness/gazebo/private/
harness/gazebo/ur5e_pick_demo.bundle

# The example project ships as a Git bundle so its two commits survive cloning.
# See example/README.md for how to restore the working copy.
example/robot_cell_vision/

# Contest submission package: the proposal deck, demo video, and all supporting
# evidence are delivered through the contest site rather than this repository.
# The files stay on local disk; only their tracking is dropped. This single rule
# replaces the earlier per-extension ones, which are now redundant.
submission/

# Technical design spec, delivered as a document rather than through the repo.
*.docx

# 方案、进展、实验记录与演示留痕，同样作为文档交付，不随代码仓库分发。
# 文件留在本地磁盘，只是不再跟踪。
design/
docs/

# 团队内部的协作约束，只对持有完整工作副本的人有效。
AGENTS.md

# 复赛录屏原始素材（约 1 GB），不进仓库
复赛资料/

# 答辩与汇报的个人草稿，只留在本地磁盘
储备.md
ppt脚本.md
专家建议.md
# Finals materials handed out by the organisers (templates, fonts, PDFs; ~51 MB)
final/
